3. **Course Code Heuristic**: Check the course codes (e.g., STRi05, VBN105, VBA206, JAV206). Typically, the first digit of the numerical part of the course code indicates the academic year:
   - Codes with numbers starting with 1 (e.g., STRi05, VBN105, ECO105, SYS105, INS105, WPB125) belong to Year 1.
   - Codes with numbers starting with 2 (e.g., VBA206, JAV206, ENW205, DBP206, BSD226, BSA216, WPA226, PLP206) belong to Year 2.
   - Codes with numbers starting with 3 belong to Year 3.
